.DS_Store

# Dependencies and build outputs (rebuilt inside Docker)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Env files (secrets must come from env vars at runtime)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.prod

# Python MLX venv (large, not needed for Node builds)
apps/mlx/.venv
apps/mlx/__pycache__
apps/mlx/**/*.pyc

# Dev artifacts
apps/api/uploads
docs
techdebt.md
README.md
